        "id": "ex-cg-a-tilde-1-infinity-edge-versus-finite-dihedral",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "The A-tilde 1 infinity edge, separated from the finite dihedral families and from the 4-edge",
        "deps": [
          "def-cg-irreducible-affine-coxeter-type",
