              "url": "https://cubicbear.github.io/doc/affineNotes.pdf",
              "locator": "Chapter 1, Section 1.4 (printed p. 3): the dihedral group D_m as the Coxeter group I_2(m); Section 1.6 (printed p. 4): the low-rank coincidence B_2=C_2; Chapter 2, Sections 2.2-2.3 (PDF p. 11): the A_1 affine Weyl group, its coroot-lattice translations, and the infinite-dihedral presentation."
