        "strategy": "Direct rank-two computation. The infinity-label Gram matrix, its radical, and the reflection product are computed in coordinates; the slice and dual wall reflections are computed on alpha; the orbit and stabilizers are checked for every integer interval. Finite labels are handled from the rank-two presentation and a two-by-two determinant, while the B2/C2 affine attachment is supplied by the earlier A-page table.",
